WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:05.680
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:09.390
Make sure you're in a well- lit room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:23.970
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.860
A brand new world is starting right now
Ima hajimarunda

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:34.440
Even if there are painful things on my way
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:40.840
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:48.600
I'm starting to walk on a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:54.830
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:58.050
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:01.180
And there's no one who can stop it
darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:06.200
My heart is tightening and jumping all over the place
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:10.560
So start flapping your wings from now
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.610
and soar high to the sky up there
ano sora he to takaku

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:19.580
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.910
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:26.180
That's what I believed
sou shinjiteiru no

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:31.340
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:54.750
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:57.500
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:04.070
<i>In order to bring peace back to Deltora, I defeated evil monsters and recovered the topaz, ruby and opal!</i>

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:07.090
<i>Honestly... You're always just being reckless though.</i>

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:07.840
<i>Jasmine!</i>

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.040
<i>It's all thanks to me that you even got this far.</i>

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.600
<i>And don't forget about me either.</i>

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.500
<i>Barda!</i>

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:15.600
<i>Filli! Kree!</i>

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:20.200
<i>We are in the middle of our journey to search for the seven gems!</i>

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.700
<i>And right now, we're on our way to the
Shifting Sands where the fourth gem is hidden!</i>

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:39.450
The following four contestants will be advancing to the semifinals:

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:40.890
Doom!

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.060
Glock!

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:47.330
Neridah!

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:51.870
And last but not least, Birdie!

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.830
To think that things would turn out this way...

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.810
<i>I... Won my match...</i>

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:12.940
<i>You won against that Orwen...?!</i>

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.540
<i>Unbelievable...</i>

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:21.100
<i>Orwen tried to attack Glock and got disqualified after your match ended, Lief...</i>

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:22.600
<i>So in other words...</i>

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:26.100
<i>I won by default, they said.</i>

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:31.380
So we who fought fair and square ended up losing...

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:35.650
While Jasmine who doesn't take this seriously at all won her match instead.

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:37.730
How ironic...

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.670
But will she be okay...?

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:43.570
She may have to fight Doom, who you couldn't beat,

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:47.380
And Glock who defeated Joanna in the following match, you know?

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:52.110
Rather than worry about her chances of victory, let's just hope for Jasmine's safety.

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:52.740
Yeah...

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.200
I've brought you all some Queen Bee Cider.

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:05.670
Thank you.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.420
Hey! Why are you bringing it to him first?!

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:20.160
You should have known who's the strongest one between us here!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:24.100
Make sure you respect the true Champion next time! And don't you dare forget it!

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.010
I-I'm sorry.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.100
Don't mind him, Dain.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:30.400
There's no need to fear him.

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:32.400
Here you go.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:36.990
Thank you! My throat has been really dry for a while now!

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:43.400
Thank you, but I had some water just before.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:46.290
But water won't give you very much strength...

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:49.400
This drink really doesn't sit well with me...

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:02.140
Hey Missy, you'd better start praying to not be paired with me for the next match.

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:06.890
Or else, you might be crushed to pieces by these big hands of mine, you know?

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:26.600
Something was mixed into this...!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.580
I-I-It must have been that brat...!

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.660
God damnit...!

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:38.130
Bring the stretchers, quickly!

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:44.500
Glock and Neridah seem to have collapsed...!

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:46.330
I wonder what's happened?

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:50.900
The boy who brought the cider is gone...

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:56.150
This is your doing, isn't it? And that boy must be your accomplice, am I right?

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:57.980
I saw you talking to him earlier.

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:00.990
What nonsense are you spouting?

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:08.400
You must have mixed some drug into other fighters' drinks so that you can win this tournament. I'm sure of it!

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.310
What a vivid imagination you have.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:13.990
You coward!

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:23.910
Just who is behind this?! This is going too far!

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:27.100
But with this, the tournament should be cancelled.

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:29.410
How long will to keep us waiting?!

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.300
Go fight each other already!!

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:33.400
I don't care who it is, give us a fight!!

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.300
Hey! How long are you going to bore us?!

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:38.750
We will now announce the results of the semifinal!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:44.610
Since Neridah and Glock were made to ingest a sleeping drug by an unknown person,

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:47.230
They are unable to continue to fight!

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:48.680
What the heck's with that?!

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.200
Order, please!

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:56.050
However, Doom and Birdie are still in top form.

00:06:56.050 --> 00:07:00.090
That's why, we're going to hold the final match right now between these two fighters!

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:01.680
What?!

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.760
They know that the situation will only worsen if they anger the spectators.

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:11.780
That's why they've chosen to do something to calm the crowd rather than search for the culprit.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:19.000
That's too bad. It seems like your victory parade has to be postponed because I didn't drink the cider.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:25.010
You probably think that it'll be an easy win against me, right?

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:27.350
But, I won't let your cowardly plan succeed!

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:32.400
I suppose not. I'll enjoy seeing what you're going to do about it.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:02.410
Let the match begin!

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:14.000
That expression of his... I really don't like it...!

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:25.100
Just what is he scheming now...?

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:29.400
This isn't good...!

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:33.300
Jasmine has begun to fear Doom.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:37.490
You're right, she's only avoiding his attacks...

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:43.160
When I fought him earlier, I felt that something was off about him...

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.610
And now, I finally know what that was.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:49.520
This man... He doesn't fear death at all...!

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:53.920
Whether he lives or dies in this match means nothing to him!

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:55.650
Beat her, beat her!

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:57.680
Make her cry!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.850
What will you do? What will you do, Little Kitten?

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:02.780
You're in a big pinch now!

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:16.140
What are you waiting for?!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.970
We won't wait here until dark just to see you beat her!!

00:09:20.010 --> 00:09:20.900
What the hell?!

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:25.410
This is the true nature of the Rithmere Games.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:26.620
True nature...?

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:33.060
All they want is to watch other people beat each other for their own amusement.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:34.430
But that's just...!

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:40.410
The true essence of combat is the clashing of skill, physical strength and mental strength.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:45.000
However, I'm sure that these people couldn't care less about that.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:59.100
Aren't you getting a little scared?

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:00.330
What...?!

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:05.010
It would suit you far better to return home to your mother, suckling her teats in safety.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:08.620
Suckling my mother's... teats...?!

00:10:16.770 --> 00:10:20.210
How dare you...! What the hell do you know about me?!

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:26.170
That's right... You must be tired by now!

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:27.220
What?

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:34.610
You've hardly had any time to rest since your last match after all, and you're not young anymore.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:44.180
Come on, come on! Come here and get me if you can!

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:57.270
Good! Keep it up!

00:10:57.270 --> 00:10:58.360
Just like that!

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:11.620
More! Make him suffer more!!

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.300
Keep those attacks coming, Missy!!

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:17.070
Take this! This! This! This!!

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.250
Good! Good! This is perfect!

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:24.000
Amazing... She might even win at this rate...!

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.240
But...

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:27.870
What's wrong?

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:30.590
Somehow, Jasmine seems different from usual...

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:33.610
You might be right...

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.000
Serves you right!

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:44.100
Birdie, watch out behind you!

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:24.870
She fell into Doom's trap...!

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:29.730
He was pushing Jasmine back bit by bit when she became too focused on attacking.

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:31.800
Magnificent!

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:36.090
I've been waiting for this kind of dramatic turn of events!

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:39.430
Make her regret stepping foot into that ring, Doom!!

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:40.990
Punish her!

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:02.320
This isn't good...!

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.630
I'll be taking that!

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:24.290
What?!

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:07.620
It seems that you're the tired one, now.

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:15.200
Then, it's about time I put an end to this!

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:18.410
The same move won't work again on me!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.200
It's useless... He knows that I'm going to jump...!

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:25.520
Now, the climax is finally here!

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:27.790
What?!

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:31.440
Let me help you with that!

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:40.060
The winner of this year's Rithmere Games is...

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:41.850
Birdie!!

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:49.140
Birdie! Birdie! Birdie! Birdie!

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:51.900
This is the greatest!

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:55.030
That was intense...

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:57.480
To think that she won like this...

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:14.700
I-Is this really all for me...?

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:17.620
Of course it is, Miss Champion.

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:31.370
With this, this year's tournament has ended. It was really fun!

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:45.630
And here it is, your very own victory feast!

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.710
Don't hold back and enjoy it!

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:52.010
A lot of crazy things happened today, after all!

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:56.890
First Orwen going berserk and then someone drugging the fighters...

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:00.510
I was really worried about it for a while, you know?

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.190
But it was all blown away by the final match!

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:08.990
After all, who wouldn't get excited after seeing such an intense fight?

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:16.280
It was great seeing how agility can win against raw strength! It was such an exciting way to win. You heard the crowd, right?

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:22.690
Oh? You seem pretty tired. I suppose it's not surprising.

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:28.240
Alright, just take it easy and enjoy my cooking, then!

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:31.300
It's the special service for the new Champion!

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:35.600
You did really well, Jasmine.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.200
Yeah, seriously.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.800
Jasmine, let's postpone our journey until tomorrow.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:43.220
Just rest up your body for tonight.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:45.260
I'm not tired...

00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:49.620
I just hate myself.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:54.560
What do you mean? You won that match fair and square, you know?

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:56.910
Just enjoy your victory!

00:16:57.240 --> 00:17:02.580
That's right! You even defeated Doom, someone I couldn't beat myself. You should be happy about that.

00:17:03.780 --> 00:17:05.700
I'm ashamed of myself...

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:10.850
I let it get to me when Doom mentioned my mum...

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:16.490
I should have known that he did that just to rile me up, and yet I played into his hands.

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:19.370
You're overthinking this.

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:24.220
After all, any person would act like that when they're angry.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:29.900
All you need to remember is that you defeated Doom. Just forget about the rest.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:34.550
Anyway, I want to leave this town as soon as possible.

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:38.820
Now, eat this and you'll be feeling better in no time!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:51.500
To tell you the truth, I really am glad that you defeated Doom back there.

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:58.210
I was pretty sure that that man was the one who drugged the cider.

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:01.270
And the fact that he disappeared so quickly only proves it further!

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:04.480
Are Glock and Neridah alright?

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:08.570
Those two are still sleeping soundly like babies for now.

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:13.870
But they will be quite disappointed to discover that the Games have ended while they slept, I'd bet.

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:19.860
By the way, Mother Brightly. We're thinking of leaving this place very soon.

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:28.180
But it's already dark outside! Just rest up for tonight, you must be tired, right?

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:33.610
If it's me you're talking about, I'm fine now. I feel much better after eating this delicious food.

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:38.000
I greatly appreciate your sentiments, but we're in a hurry.

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:43.030
If you're saying that much, I suppose I can't force you...

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:48.400
So anyway, we were wanting to buy a few things before we left.

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:50.600
Do you know of any good stores?

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:56.670
Then look no further! We have the best goods that any traveller would ever need!

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.150
Amazing!

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:08.400
I'm sure we can find everything that we need here! You have our thanks!

00:19:11.490 --> 00:19:13.630
Look, this seems so warm...!

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.840
I bet we could fit a lot of things inside this!

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:35.000
Thank you very much.

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:40.160
We really are indebted to you, Mother Brightly. Thank you so much.

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:41.000
Then, excuse us.

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:43.290
Please wait a moment.

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:50.200
I don't want to say anything bad about this town or about the Games, but...

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:54.580
I feel like you three have the right to know.

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:57.500
What is it? Please, do tell us.

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:03.310
I have heard a lot of stories of champions and of those who made it into the main tournament...

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:07.390
And about how they meet with misfortune when they try to leave this place.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:13.900
In other words, they were attacked and robbed of their gold coins, then?

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:17.240
That's right.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:20.560
Gold coins are a rather attractive target, after all.

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:24.980
The culprit may very well be stalking this inn, I believe.

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:30.210
Because those who leave this place at this time are most likely people who advanced to the main tournament.

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:33.430
In other words, people with lots of gold coins on them.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:39.470
But you don't need to worry! You can still leave from my underground storage room.

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:42.470
You'll reach a back alley that is somewhat out of the way.

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:46.380
Using this, no one will realise that you've gone.

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:50.160
We'll take you up on your offer. We're really thankful for that!

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:52.890
Wait for us outside, Kree.

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:59.820
Really, thank you again! You've done so much for us.

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.000
You're a very kind-hearted person.

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:09.470
This way. Oh, and be careful since it's a bit low.

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:18.600
Take care, okay? Farewell.

00:21:19.150 --> 00:21:21.100
Thank you. Good bye.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:31.000
She really is a good person, isn't she? Wouldn't it have been fine to just stay another night?

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:35.170
No way. I wouldn't be able to bear staying in this town any longer.

00:21:35.170 --> 00:21:39.530
Besides, we can't afford to be distracted for too long.

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:43.290
We still have to look for the other gems as soon as possible.

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:44.900
Yeah, you're right.

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:48.620
Is that it?

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:56.590
I can't open it. It's locked.

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:58.520
That's impossible!

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:01.000
Maybe it's just stuck on something?

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:40.390
Every moment is a gate to fantasia
Every moment is a gate to fantasia

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:47.690
You just do it to be an shining star
You just do it to be an shining star

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:51.050
Ooh la la! The gentle wind that's brushing my cheek in the evening
Ooh la la! Yawarakana kaze hoo naderu yuugata

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:53.560
If you start to walk with your head held high
Moshi kimi ga uemuki arukidasu nara

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:57.980
The big red sun will surely give its blessing to you
Ooki na akai taiyou ga kimi wo shukufuku shitekureru darou

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:00.480
If you stay stricken because you stumbled
Nanika ni tsumazuki uchihishigarete

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:02.780
And keep hanging your head in shame
Moshi kimi ga utsumuitamama nara

00:23:03.070 --> 00:23:05.070
Then you are probably going to miss
Sono kandouteki na ONE SCENE

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:07.840
That very touching one scene
Nogashite shimau kamoshirenai kara

00:23:07.840 --> 00:23:10.660
HEY NOW ! Everything that lives on this earth
HEY NOW ! Kono chikyuu de ikiru mono subete

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:13.210
Sea, Sky, Sun that blessed us in these 7 Days
Umi, sora to taiyou megumi no 7 DAYS

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:16.010
Since when did I get this thirsty?
Itsu kara ka nodo kawakikittamama

